     staticmethod expr7 3 init funccode  code  time interval f rolling eq $function code    ord funccode       code  $ask order  $bid order      time interval s    sum     rolling $function code    time interval s    count test exp 08 1 expr8 1 funccode  ordercode  time interval short  time interval long  f tresample gt expr7 init funccode  ordercode  time interval short expr7 init funccode  ordercode  time interval long      1min    mean   
         

        exprs     
        names funccode b    s ordercode 0    1   
                exprs append expr8 1 funccode  ordercode   10    900   
                names append trans dict ordercode trans dict funccode      relative intensity 10s 900s  

        df   d features stocks list  fields exprs  freq  order  
        df columns   names
        print df test exp 08 2 expr8 2 funccode  ordercode  time interval short  time interval long  f tresample gt expr7 3 init funccode  ordercode  time interval short expr7 3 init funccode  ordercode  time interval long      1min    mean   
         

        exprs    expr8 2  c    gt    10    900    expr8 2  c    lt    10    900   
        names     ca relative intensity 10s 900s    cb relative intensity 10s 900s  

        df   d features stocks list  fields exprs  freq  transaction  
        df columns   names
        print df test exp 09 trans exprs    
            f tresample div sub tresample expr7 3 init  c    gt    3      3s    last    ref tresample expr7 3 init  c    gt    3      3s   last    1    3    1min    mean    
            f tresample div sub tresample expr7 3 init  c    lt    3      3s    last    ref tresample expr7 3 init  c    lt    3      3s   last    1    3    1min    mean    
         
        names     ca diff intensity 3s 3s    cb diff intensity 3s 3s  
        df   d features stocks list  fields exprs  freq  transaction  
        df columns   names
        print df test exp 09 order exprs     
        names funccode b    s ordercode 0    1   
                exprs append 
                    f tresample div sub tresample expr7 init funccode  ordercode   3      3s    last    ref tresample expr7 init funccode  ordercode   3     3s    last    1    3    1min    mean   
                 
                names append trans dict ordercode trans dict funccode      diff intensity 3s 3s  
        df   d features stocks list  fields exprs  freq  order  
        df columns   names
        print df test exp 10 exprs     
        names 5  10  30  60  
            exprs append 
                f tresample ref tresample $ask1   $bid1   1s    ffill tresample $ask1   $bid1   1s    ffill   - 1   1min    mean    
             
            names append f lag change rate 5  10  30  60  
        df   d features stocks list  fields exprs  freq  ticks  
